<title>POLAND: DOMPLAST AUG NET RISES TO PLN 0.9 MLN.</title>
<headline>DOMPLAST AUG NET RISES TO PLN 0.9 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results August</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.92 vs   0.44</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.71 vs   0.73</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.73 vs   0.96</p>
<p> Sales		    6.56 vs   7.12</p>
<p>JANUARY-AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit	     6.10 vs   2.80</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	11.86 vs   4.51</p>
<p> Operating profit    11.49 vs   5.41</p>
<p> Sales		   47.50 vs  52.90</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish plastic houseware maker is</p>
<p>DomPlast SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
